OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters tackle blaze in
OL,4,Afourth floor tenement flat in Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have been tackling a blaze
OL,7,Fwhich took hold in a fourth floor
OL,8,Ftenement flat in the north of Glasgow.
OL,10,FThe Scottish Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,F(SFRS) said six fire engines and
OL,12,Fspecialist resources were sent to
OL,13,FStonyhurst Street in Possilpark at
OL,14,Fabout 16:50.
OL,16,FPictures posted on social media showed
OL,17,Fflames emerging from the roof of a
OL,18,Fbuilding which was covered in
OL,19,Fscaffolding.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
